DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43992::$$$message_0376_0000_0000$$$::"Two pair of seven. Rome."::
43993::$$$message_0376_0000_0001$$$::"Rome? That ain't lookin' good. Then I play Mango and pair of eights."::
43994::$$$message_0376_0000_0002$$$::"Pair of two. It's gold, so I win.[lr]::
43995::$$$message_0376_0000_0003$$$::[hfsigh layer=0]Next up... Going with three cards? Then I'll start with six. The theme is something Saber would like."::
43996::$$$message_0376_0000_0004$$$::"Triple nines. Pretty boy."::
43997::$$$message_0376_0000_0005$$$::"Tch. [hfchance layer=0]You lot are always throwing out cards like there's no tomorrow. I'm the only one who can't pass."::
43998::$$$message_0376_0000_0006$$$::"...Triple Jacks. And a plain Short Sword that's the complete opposite of a certain someone's tastes."::
43999::$$$message_0376_0000_0007$$$::"I object. I'm sure that Saber enjoys extravagant ornamentation. That play doesn't count. Do it over."::
44000::$$$message_0376_0000_0008$$$::"No, I support Lancer in this. He isn't wrong about what Saber would prefer."::
44001::$$$message_0376_0000_0009$$$::"Ha! Don't make me laugh, Kotomine. What would you know about Saber?"::
44002::$$$message_0376_0000_0010$$$::"No one is more familiar with her lifestyle than I am. What evidence do you have for such a statement?"::
44003::$$$message_0376_0000_0011$$$::"The other day, I gave her some of the nightwear that Rin returned to me, but Saber destroyed it in front of me. A shame. I only meant it as a simple act of goodwill."::
44004::$$$message_0376_0000_0012$$$::"Hahahahahaha! You fool! Did you think Saber would accept tribute!?"::
44005::$$$message_0376_0001_0000$$$::"She turns me down once a day! It's only natural she'd react that way!"::
44006::$$$message_0376_0001_0001$$$::"Very well. This amused me greatly, so I will allow it. Your evidence is weak, but I will select more subtle gifts for her, starting tomorrow."::
44007::$$$message_0376_0001_0002$$$::"By the way, triple ones. Cash box. Anyone willing to call my bet?"::
44008::$$$message_0376_0001_0003$$$::"Pass."::
44009::$$$message_0376_0001_0004$$$::"Same here. Obviously not. You already played a pair of two, and those beat ones."::
44010::$$$message_0376_0001_0005$$$::"I see. I should be careful about coming on too strong.[lr]::
44011::$$$message_0376_0001_0006$$$::[hffacechg chara=ギルガメッシュ face=楽 layer=0 time=200]Hmm... Fine, then. I will give you all a chance to defy me."::
44012::$$$message_0376_0001_0007$$$::"Here, a three of Hearts. It's only one card, so you should be able to fight back. The theme is something Saber would like."::
44013::$$$message_0376_0001_0008$$$::"Six of Hearts. Hoodie with dog ears."::
44014::$$$message_0376_0001_0009$$$::"(We're finally down to the low-card plays. He has one left... I bet Kotomine is hiding the last picture card, though...)"::
44015::$$$message_0376_0001_0010$$$::"Dammit, as if I'd let you run off with this win! Eat this ace of Tiger Cub! And, um...[stopmove][hfchance layer=0]Dorayaki!"::
44016::$$$message_0376_0001_0011$$$::"Kuh, why so feeble!? If you're going with a Tiger Cub, then bring your strongest cards, spear fodder!"::
44017::$$$message_0376_0001_0012$$$::"Here, a two of Hearts. I am the one they idolize as Goldy! I'm calling this match!"::
44018::$$$message_0376_0001_0013$$$::"Say what!? Whaddya think you're doing? Don't you know the rules of daifugo!?"::
44019::$$$message_0376_0002_0000$$$::"You can't call the match with twos,[hfchance layer=0] and it automatically puts you in last place!"::
44020::$$$message_0376_0002_0001$$$::"And what are you prattling on about?[lr]::
44021::$$$message_0376_0002_0002$$$::I win on twos. There's no way I'd lose after playing my strongest card."::
44022::$$$message_0376_0002_0003$$$::"You're the one who's spouting trash, Goldy![lr]::
44023::$$$message_0376_0002_0004$$$::Argh, you're dead last! This isn't even a contest! [hfwww layer=0]You go scout it out!"::
44024::$$$message_0376_0002_0005$$$::"...Pathetic. I don't know what provincial rules you're playing by just so you don't have to acknowledge your own loss."::
44025::$$$message_0376_0003_0000$$$::"But in my country, calling the match on a two is A-OK."::
44026::$$$message_0376_0003_0001$$$::"Why can't I use twos to begin with? Is there some precedent that established the rule?"::
44027::$$$message_0376_0004_0000$$$::"I'm not unwilling to hear you out if you can explain yourself, Lancer."::
44028::$$$message_0376_0004_0001$$$::"Afraid I can't. You could say it helps the other players to turn the tables, or at least stop this game from being totally one-sided."::
44029::$$$message_0376_0004_0002$$$::"Anyway, it's a rule to keep you from running off with a huge lead."::
44030::$$$message_0376_0004_0003$$$::"Kotomine. This blue guy is talking like he knows all about rules he barely even understands."::
44031::$$$message_0376_0005_0000$$$::"I'm truly stunned by his conceit."::
44032::$$$message_0376_0005_0001$$$::"Hahaha. Forgive him, Gilgamesh."::
44033::$$$message_0376_0006_0000$$$::"Lancer's placed last seven times running. At least let him whine."::
44034::$$$message_0376_0006_0001$$$::"This ain't whining! I'm talking about [font italic=true]actual[font italic=false] rules!"::
44035::$$$message_0376_0006_0002$$$::"Why aren't you following them!? Are you telling me the way this Goldy just hogs all the ones, twos, and picture cards without following any actual rules counts as winning!?"::
44036::$$$message_0376_0006_0003$$$::"I don't know why you're asking me. I'm fighting this battle using the same cards as you."::
44037::$$$message_0376_0006_0004$$$::"I don't wanna hear that when you're just aiming for second place every time!"::
44038::$$$message_0376_0007_0000$$$::"[hfchance layer=1]...Damn it, while I'm at it, I'll just make one thing clear."::
44039::$$$message_0376_0007_0001$$$::"You just called me here to fight because it was convenient!"::
44040::$$$message_0376_0007_0002$$$::"I wasn't summoned to look after a self-styled king who does nothing but spend, eat, and sleep..."::
44041::$$$message_0376_0008_0000$$$::"...and a priest who pushes all his busywork onto other people!"::
44042::$$$message_0376_0008_0001$$$::"How vexing to hear that. I feel like I've had some measure of personal growth, lately."::
44043::$$$message_0376_0008_0002$$$::"Hahaha. What's wrong with that? We're having fun."::
44044::$$$message_0376_0008_0003$$$::"Everything's wrong with it, for me! [se storage=se181.wav]Stay right where you are! I'll knock some sense into you both!"::
44045::$$$message_0376_0008_0004$$$::"All right, cards are for cowards. Put that away and let's play a game for [font italic=true]real[font italic=false] men."::
44046::$$$message_0376_0008_0005$$$::"Backgammon, eh? I can be rather competitive."::
44047::$$$message_0376_0008_0006$$$::"Hrm. It seems dull."::
44048::$$$message_0376_0009_0000$$$::"Personally, I like games where I get to collect everything. Very well, teach me the rules, spear fodder."::
44049::$$$message_0376_0010_0000$$$::"I thought I sensed Lancer here, but talk about a party..."::
44050::$$$message_0376_0010_0001$$$::"It's obvious Kotomine is up to no good, but I didn't expect [font italic=true]him[font italic=false] to be here, too... [hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR7_BIR_0030 _name=ブルマイリヤ]What now, Taiga?"[skip_next_tag len=2][l][br]::
44051::$$$message_0376_0010_0002$$$::"You're asking me? What do we do now, Illya!?"::
44052::$$$message_0376_0011_0000$$$::[se storage=se023.wav][movefg textoff=0 opacity=200 left=0 top=0 time=100 accel=0 storage=08魔術・電撃][lquake layer=2 wait=0 hmax=0 vmax=25 interval=0][wm canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=100][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=0 top=0 time=600 accel=0 storage=08魔術・電撃]"Eek, I'm terrified...![lr]::
44053::$$$message_0376_0011_0001$$$::Why are they just playing daifugo there...!"[wm canskip=0][hfstopquake layer=2]::
44054::$$$message_0376_0011_0002$$$::"Oh, is that what bothers you?"::
44055::$$$message_0376_0011_0003$$$::"I can't believe it... I-I-I don't think we can win this at all!"::
44056::$$$message_0376_0012_0000$$$::"Especially against that gold one. I'm getting chills, like if we make one wrong move, he'll turn into comic relief just like me."::
44057::$$$message_0376_0012_0001$$$::"Ahh... You haven't gone up against someone as airheaded as you before. It's three versus two, so should we just watch for now?"::
44058::$$$message_0376_0012_0002$$$::"I have a feeling they'll start fighting amongst themselves if we leave them alone."::
44059::$$$message_0376_0012_0003$$$::"Urgh. Um, tempting as that is, you know me, I'm incapable of leaving someone alone."::
44060::$$$message_0376_0012_0004$$$::"Instead of racking my brains over loopy strategies, [l][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HSTR7_TIG_0080 _name=藤ねえ]I think we should just pick a fight!"::
44061::$$$message_0376_0012_0005$$$::"I figured you'd say that. [l][hfsigh layer=1][say storage=HSTR7_BIR_0090 _name=ブルマイリヤ]You're so foolhardy."::
44062::$$$message_0376_0012_0006$$$::"Mrgh. Are you going to order me to retreat, as my Master?"::
44063::$$$message_0376_0012_0007$$$::"Of course not. This is you we're talking about. I'll follow you into the depths of hell if I have to."::
44064::$$$message_0376_0013_0000$$$::"As long as you're an idiot, we can take on anyone."::
44065::$$$message_0376_0013_0001$$$::"Mmm, what an enthusiastic pupil.[br]::
44066::$$$message_0376_0013_0002$$$::I might be in love."::
44067::$$$message_0376_0013_0003$$$::"...But it sounds like you're not really driven yourself, Illya."::
44068::$$$message_0376_0013_0004$$$::"Hmm... You're right, Master."::
44069::$$$message_0376_0013_0005$$$::"When I look at the gold guy, my heart seizes up. Could this be love...?"::
44070::$$$message_0376_0013_0006$$$::"It's like...I wanna tear his heart out."::
44071::$$$message_0376_0013_0007$$$::"I don't think 'love' quite fits. Maybe it's some new take on the suspension bridge effect."[nolr][p]::
44072::$$$message_0376_0013_0008$$$::"Argh, she just can't escape her sadistic loli ways... The Holy Grail War is, in the end, a game of passionate murder where love equals killing..."::
44073::$$$message_0376_0014_0000$$$::"All right, that's quite enough, you jolly three![lr]::
44074::$$$message_0376_0014_0001$$$::This is the end of the Holy Grail War. Hand over your star!"::
44075::$$$message_0376_0014_0002$$$::"Hey Kotomine, what's their deal? Don't tell me you're running some shady side hustle again."::
44076::$$$message_0376_0014_0003$$$::"On the contrary, they're in the same business as we are, Lancer. It's the girl who became a Master the other day, and her Servant."::
44077::$$$message_0376_0014_0004$$$::"I'm fairly sure she intends to abandon her rights as a Master and seek my protection..."::
44078::$$$message_0376_0014_0005$$$::"You've got it all wrong, Kotomine."::
44079::$$$message_0376_0014_0006$$$::"We're here because we survived.[lr]::
44080::$$$message_0376_0014_0007$$$::We're not running away. We tracked you to your little hideout and we're going to defeat you."::
44081::$$$message_0376_0014_0008$$$::"Now, now. I think you should be clearer."::
44082::$$$message_0376_0015_0000$$$::"You're making it sound as if you defeated the other five teams."::
44083::$$$message_0376_0015_0001$$$::"Surely, that's impossible.[lr]::
44084::$$$message_0376_0015_0002$$$::I'm sorry, but please rephrase your story."::
44085::$$$message_0376_0015_0003$$$::"Like she said, we kicked all the other Masters' butts and you're the only ones left."::
44086::$$$message_0376_0016_0000$$$::"See? Check out these six stars."::
44087::$$$message_0376_0016_0001$$$::"..."::
44088::$$$message_0376_0016_0002$$$::"Say what!? [hfchance layer=1]That is [font italic=true]not[font italic=false] how you said this would go, Kotomine!"::
44089::$$$message_0376_0017_0000$$$::"I thought you said it just started and that there wouldn't be any war!"::
44090::$$$message_0376_0017_0001$$$::"[line len=12]"::
44091::$$$message_0376_0017_0002$$$::"His soul is leaving his body...!"::
44092::$$$message_0376_0017_0003$$$::"Heyyy. Come back to us, Kotomine.[lr]::
44093::$$$message_0376_0017_0004$$$::I see why you're shocked, but this is what you get for playing games every day."::
44094::$$$message_0376_0017_0005$$$::"...Huh!?"::
44095::$$$message_0376_0017_0006$$$::".........[hfchance layer=0]Heh. I see.[lr]::
44096::$$$message_0376_0017_0007$$$::I predicted that you might survive until the end, but you actually made it here this quickly."::
44097::$$$message_0376_0017_0008$$$::"Let me first commend you, Illyasviel. But this was all within my expectations."::
44099::$$$message_0376_0017_0010$$$::"Okay. Everything's going to be okay. No problem.[lr]::
44100::$$$message_0376_0017_0011$$$::Now, let us see how well you can fight with those battered and broken bodies...!"::
44101::$$$message_0376_0017_0012$$$::"...Lancer, I suddenly feel like playing some of my RPG backlog."::
44102::$$$message_0376_0017_0013$$$::"...That's the first time I've ever agreed with you. I just remembered I had some chores to finish in the attic."::
44103::$$$message_0376_0017_0014$$$::"Hahaha. That's a death flag, spear fodder."::
44104::$$$message_0376_0017_0015$$$::"That goes for you, too!"::
44105::$$$message_0376_0017_0016$$$::"What are you doing, Lancer, Archer![lr]::
44106::$$$message_0376_0017_0017$$$::A single unidentified Servant is no match for you!"::
44107::$$$message_0376_0017_0018$$$::"We will finish this Holy Grail War with a perfect victory, just as planned!"::
44108::$$$message_0376_0017_0019$$$::"What plan?[lr]::
44109::$$$message_0376_0017_0020$$$::...Still, it is my duty to salvage my contractor's failed strategy. I suppose that leaves us no choice but to cooperate, spear fodder!"::
44110::$$$message_0376_0017_0021$$$::"That's my line! Make sure to keep up, prodigal son!"[nolr][p]::
44111::$$$message_0376_0017_0022$$$::"Ngh...! Kotomine seems kinda desperate, but the two behind him are the real deal![lr]::
44112::$$$message_0376_0017_0023$$$::[hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=真剣 layer=1 left=7 top=397 time=200][hfchance layer=1]Be careful, Taiga!"::
44113::$$$message_0376_0017_0024$$$::"I know... I'll have to fight like our lives are on the line to beat these three! [l][hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=真剣3 index=4000 layer=0 time=200][say storage=HSTR7_TIG_0200 _name=藤ねえ]Here we go, Illya! Watch my back!"::
44114::$$$message_0376_0017_0025$$$::"Okay! I'll handle the healing![lr]::
44115::$$$message_0376_0017_0026$$$::It'll be all right! No matter how badly they beat you up, I'll use my Command Spells to force you to keep fighting!"::
44116::$$$message_0376_0017_0027$$$::"Eeeek! I gotta watch [font italic=true]my[font italic=false] back, too![lr]::
44117::$$$message_0376_0017_0028$$$::I-I knew lolis were devils to the core!"[nolr][p]�w�F